<view class="page {{themeClass}} {{fontClass}}">
  <view class="dashboard-header">
    <view class="badge">紧急协助</view>
    <view class="title">一键 SOS</view>
    <view class="tip">遇到宠物异常、入户风险或突发情况时立即提交，管理端会进入异常处理。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="notice danger">
    <view class="strong">请优先保障人宠安全</view>
    <view class="muted">描述现场情况并提交平台处理；如需电话联络宠物主，请联系平台客服并报订单号，由管理员转接。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card info-list">
    <view class="subtitle">平台客服转接</view>
    <view class="info-row"><view class="label">订单号</view><view class="value">{{order.orderNo || orderId}}</view></view>
    <view class="info-row"><view class="label">客服电话</view><view class="value">{{customerService.phone || '暂未配置'}}</view></view>
    <view class="info-row" wx:if="{{customerService.workHours}}"><view class="label">工作时间</view><view class="value">{{customerService.workHours}}</view></view>
    <button class="ghost" bindtap="callCustomerService">联系平台客服</button>
    <button class="ghost" bindtap="copyOrderNo">复制订单号</button>
  </view>

  <view class="card form-card">
    <textarea placeholder="描述现场情况" value="{{description}}" bindinput="input" />
  </view>

  <button class="danger" bindtap="submit">提交 SOS</button>
</view>
